WEBVTT

00:15:28.676 --> 00:15:30.116
if they want to stay relevant:

00:15:30.156 --> 00:15:32.836
ask themselves the questions of a gambler.

00:15:32.876 --> 00:15:35.196
Why were we actually successful?

00:15:35.236 --> 00:15:37.556
How do we separate luck from skill?

00:15:37.956 --> 00:15:43.076
Is it possible that our league table
sometimes lied too?

00:15:43.116 --> 00:15:44.716
Thank you very much.